{"user": "if i'd started with b8 instead would that have stopped white from taking a8?", "user_ts": "2026-08-12T20:55:13.914136+00:00", "assistant": "Probably **no** \u2014 playing **b8** usually does **not** stop White from taking **a8**. In fact, if **a8 is empty**, a Black disc on **b8** often *helps* make **a8 legal for White**.\n\nRule of thumb: **the squares next to an empty corner \u2014 b8, a7, b7 \u2014 are dangerous** unless you\u2019ve calculated the whole ending.\n\nSo **b8 only works if it leaves White with no legal a8 next**, or if you can take a8 yourself soon after. Otherwise it likely just hands White the corner.", "assistant_started_ts": "2026-08-12T20:55:13.914136+00:00", "assistant_ts": "2026-08-12T20:55:18.914136+00:00", "annotation_user": {"final": ["Common Ground Question"], "consensus": ["Common Ground Question"], "votes": {"Common Ground Question": 3, "Knowledge Deficit Question": 1}, "confidence": {"Common Ground Question": 1.0, "Knowledge Deficit Question": 0.3333333333333333}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Common Ground Question"], "llama": ["Knowledge Deficit Question", "Common Ground Question"], "sonnet": ["Common Ground Question"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false}, "annotation_assistant_fine": {"final": ["Local Justification", "General Principle", "Negative Feedback"], "consensus": ["Local Justification", "General Principle", "Negative Feedback"], "votes": {"Move Verdict": 1, "Local Justification": 3, "General Principle": 3, "Negative Feedback": 2, "Neutral Feedback": 1}, "confidence": {"Move Verdict": 0.3333333333333333, "Local Justification": 1.0, "General Principle": 1.0, "Negative Feedback": 0.6666666666666666, "Neutral Feedback": 0.3333333333333333}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Move Verdict", "Local Justification", "General Principle", "Negative Feedback"], "sonnet": ["Local Justification", "General Principle", "Neutral Feedback"], "llama": ["Local Justification", "General Prin